  "implemented": [
    "Opaque immutable-borrow ResultEncoding with exact encoded_len and fixed-slice write_exact, driven by the original ordered emitter.",
    "encode_result preserves its public signature and canonical bytes; complete validation precedes one fallible exact Vec reservation.",
    "Native query validates/counts without materializing and discarding a complete wire Vec.",
    "Native prepublication encoding allocation failure rolls back and maps to existing ResourceExhausted; wire maps that local resource error to LIMIT.",
    "Existing known-commit service conversion failures keep original trusted receipt and COMMITTED_BUT_UNAVAILABLE."
  ],
