  },
  "limits": [
    "Exact visible Vec capacity is conditional on the fixed Rust toolchain; it is not malloc rounding, RSS or global allocator control.",
    "Base64 and final JSON still use their current allocation paths.",
    "No global/tenant output ledger, final Bytes charge lifetime or admission reserve is implemented by this slice.",
    "Default typed-result budget remains separate; core retained Vec, frames, native VM/cache and transport allocations remain outside the proposed service encoding pool.",
    "No AWS/SLO/throughput result is claimed."
  ],
